{"id":"ignorancia","lemma":"ignorancia","pos":"noun","rank":4848,"glosses":["ignorance"],"ipa":"/iɡnoˈɾanθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ignorancias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ignorancia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella se aprovechó de mi ignorancia.","en":"She took advantage of my ignorance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687269","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to make use of","l":"aprovechar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Deberías estar avergonzado de tu ignorancia.","en":"You should be ashamed of your ignorance.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"embarrassed, ashamed"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Él parecía sorprendido de mi ignorancia.","en":"He seemed surprised by my ignorance.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"surprised"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"La ignorancia es una bendición.","en":"Ignorance is bliss.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38908","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"blessing"}]},{"text":"A menudo se aprovecha de su ignorancia.","en":"She often takes advantage of his ignorance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608763","words":[null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to make use of","l":"aprovechar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"often, oftentimes"]]}]}